# CODEOWNERS for the Atlas monorepo
#
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Rules:
#   - The LAST matching pattern wins, so we keep the catch-all default at the top
#     and more specific paths below it.
#   - A matching line replaces (does not add to) the owners from earlier lines.
#   - Owners can be teams (@diamondlightsource/<team-slug>) or users (@username),
#     space separated. Teams must have write access to this repo.
#   - A path with no owners listed after it has no code owner.
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default owners: Atlas Core team
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
